WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.310
- I asked Jimmy and Maya
whenever they were here,

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:04.770
memories of Prince, you know,

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.860
because I heard about the huge
40th anniversary SNL party.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.690
And it sounds like the most epic party

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:11.870
in all of the lands.
- Yeah.

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:14.223
So what do you remember about that night?

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:19.040
- Well, I mean, it was
the party that only exists

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.150
in like works of fiction.

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:25.150
We never would have that
many people together again,

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.570
but I remember my wife and I
were weaving through the crowd.

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:29.620
Right as Prince was on stage.

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.500
And it's very strange,

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.967
you never think of like
famous people going like this,

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:35.450
"Excuse me, excuse me."

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:36.290
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:38.860
But it was so densely packed

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:41.100
and I was doing the excuse me

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.120
and then just came like,

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:45.860
you know, my face came
like this close to Beyonce

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:48.050
and I, we were, you know, we,

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:50.137
our eyes met and I just was like,

00:00:50.137 --> 00:00:51.691
"Pretty cool party, right?

00:00:51.691 --> 00:00:52.524
(audience laughs)

00:00:52.524 --> 00:00:53.890
And she said, "Yeah."

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:55.530
And then we just kept going,

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.021
like the momentum took us away.

00:00:57.021 --> 00:00:57.854
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:57.854 --> 00:00:59.437
And my wife said,

00:00:59.437 --> 00:01:02.011
"Wow, you really, really
killed that interaction."

00:01:02.011 --> 00:01:05.178
(Kelly laughing)
- Hi!

00:01:06.738 --> 00:01:07.820
She then she said, "Hi."
- You better leave

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:09.050
your ringer on
- And I said, "Hi."

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:09.990
- Cause you're probably
going to get a call

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:10.933
from Beyonce.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:14.207
- She said "Hi," then I said "Hi,"

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:15.140
and then it was over.

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.100
It was awesome.

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:17.010
- I said, I dunno if you heard,

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.370
I was like "Pretty cool party, right?"

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:19.360
And then she was like, "Yeah."

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:20.784
And like, I went pretty good.

00:01:20.784 --> 00:01:21.732
(Kelly laughing)

